                                                "text": "\"Who ever heard of a girl named Zoe! You never did yourself.\" ¶ \"I know I never did, Roy Kemble, but just the same I think it is the most beautiful name in the world. It isn't so much what it really means; names don't have to mean anything - it's what it feels like it means."
